# Runtime deferrals, read by vulns: name@version<TAB>until<TAB>reason.
# They cover this repository's devShell, and the runtimes installed on hosts
# that import it, which dotfiles-mac's vulns host reads.
python@3.14.8	2026-11-07	3.14.10 (NixOS/nixpkgs#580027) is in staging-next (NixOS/nixpkgs#580394), not in nixpkgs-unstable yet; same finding as dotfiles-mac#298
nodejs@24.22.2	2026-12-05	24.22.3 (security release, 2026-11-10; NixOS/nixpkgs#586806) is in nixpkgs master since 2026-11-11 but nixpkgs-unstable has not advanced since 2026-11-22 and has 24.22.2; on the host, read by dotfiles-mac's vulns host (#5)
